#: 9486453802684567b601cf001f802160
msgid "How to get changes approved"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:88
#: dc0cf7116023414499428fb807b69fa3
msgid "All changes to the wiki are `reviewed <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/pulls>`__ by the wiki \"maintainers\" to help reduce the chance of misleading or incorrect information being posted.  Feel free to post comments in the PullRequest and/or attend the :ref:`weekly dev meeting <dev:ardupilot-discord-server>` to escalate getting your changes submitted."
msgstr ""
